WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.234
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:03.501
You're here.
You made it.

00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:05.100
Thank you very much.
Thanks for tuning in.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:09.300
Let's get to some news.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.000
Well, guys, as the war
rages on in Ukraine,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.534
former President Trump

00:00:13.534 --> 00:00:16.200
said that he's surprised
Putin invaded Ukraine

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.200
and that Putin's changed.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.801 --> 00:00:21.968
Trump went on to say,

00:00:21.968 --> 00:00:23.767
"This is not the man
I fell in love with."

00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:25.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:27.133
That's right.
Trump talks about Putin

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:29.133
like he's his nephew
who started vaping.

00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:32.934
"Everything was fine,
then one day..."

00:00:32.934 --> 00:00:34.267
That's right.
Trump is surprised,

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:36.300
which is kind of what happens
when you flush

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.501
four years of intelligence
briefings down the toilet.

00:00:38.501 --> 00:00:39.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.868 --> 00:00:42.968
You guys hear about this?
The CDC just lowered the COVID

00:00:42.968 --> 00:00:47.367
risk level for cruise ships
from high to moderate.

00:00:47.367 --> 00:00:49.701
However, the risk of getting
salmonella from the chicken

00:00:49.701 --> 00:00:50.968
is still pretty much guaranteed.

00:00:50.968 --> 00:00:52.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.868 --> 00:00:55.801
I guess this announcement is for
all two people who book cruises

00:00:55.801 --> 00:00:57.334
and listen to the CDC.

00:00:57.334 --> 00:00:59.634
It's like,
"CDC says we shouldn't."

00:00:59.634 --> 00:01:03.200
"There's a waterslide."
"Let's book it. Let's go."

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.634
Some business news.

00:01:04.634 --> 00:01:06.801
It's a little controversial,
but Chipotle is gonna start

00:01:06.801 --> 00:01:10.334
using a robot
to make their tortilla chips.

00:01:10.334 --> 00:01:12.133
Yeah, and they're
calling it Chippy.

00:01:12.133 --> 00:01:13.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.701 --> 00:01:15.834
Yeah. They also have a robot
to clean the bathroom,

00:01:15.834 --> 00:01:17.367
but we can't say
his name on TV.

00:01:17.367 --> 00:01:18.834
-Oh, hey!

00:01:18.834 --> 00:01:21.434
[ Rimshot ]

00:01:21.434 --> 00:01:26.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.167 --> 00:01:29.000
-Yeah, somehow Chipotle can
build a chip-making robot

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.334
but can't make a cardboard bowl
that doesn't leak bean juice.

00:01:31.334 --> 00:01:32.601
You know what I'm saying?
Isn't that interesting?

00:01:32.601 --> 00:01:33.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.834 --> 00:01:35.834
Get this --
nearly 4 million bottles

00:01:35.834 --> 00:01:38.200
of Airborne
immune support gummies

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:41.234
have been recalled after people
reported eye injuries

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:43.300
from the cap popping off.

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:46.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:48.334
Apparently, when they said
"airborne," they meant the cap.

00:01:48.334 --> 00:01:49.868
-Oh.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.868 --> 00:01:51.267
-Airborne's trying to spin it.
They're like,

00:01:51.267 --> 00:01:52.834
"Well, you're not complaining
about your cold anymore,

00:01:52.834 --> 00:01:54.300
are you?"
"No, I guess you're right.

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:56.033
Yeah, you're right."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:58.267
Some TV news --
last night, did anyone see

00:01:58.267 --> 00:01:59.501
the finale of "The Bachelor"?

00:01:59.501 --> 00:02:01.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:01.601 --> 00:02:04.801
It was a crazy, crazy ending.
No spoilers here,

00:02:04.801 --> 00:02:07.701
but they did make a big
announcement about who the next

00:02:07.701 --> 00:02:10.067
Bachelorette will be.
Watch this.

00:02:10.067 --> 00:02:12.734
-Now, look, I already told you
it's not Gabby.

00:02:12.734 --> 00:02:14.901
[ Audience "Awws" ]

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.467
And it's also not Rachel.
[ Audience "Awws" ]

00:02:17.467 --> 00:02:19.501
It's Gabby and Rachel!

00:02:19.501 --> 00:02:23.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:23.334 --> 00:02:26.701
-Wow!
Wow!

00:02:26.701 --> 00:02:28.200
Two Bachelorettes, yeah.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:30.801
If you think it's weird dating
two girls at the same time,

00:02:30.801 --> 00:02:32.934
then you've never watched
an episode of "The Bachelor."

00:02:32.934 --> 00:02:34.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:35.501
That's right.
Inflation is so bad,

00:02:35.501 --> 00:02:37.100
it's even raising
the number of Bachelorettes.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:39.434
It's interesting.
-Oh.

00:02:39.434 --> 00:02:41.701
-Oh, this is interesting.
I saw that Spotify has agreed

00:02:41.701 --> 00:02:44.167
to sponsor
Barcelona's biggest soccer club,

00:02:44.167 --> 00:02:47.167
so now their name and logo
will appear on the team's jersey

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:49.767
and stadium.
It's good news for Spotify,

00:02:49.767 --> 00:02:51.734
but you can already tell
they're having an influence

00:02:51.734 --> 00:02:54.200
on the way games are broadcast.
Take a look at this.

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:56.300
-We've seen that move before.
Beautiful pass.

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:57.734
And Ferran Torres has the shot.

00:02:57.734 --> 00:03:01.334
J-o-o-o-o-o-o-oe...

00:03:01.334 --> 00:03:03.567
Rogan!
New episodes every day,

00:03:03.567 --> 00:03:05.534
1:00 p.m., here on Spotify.

00:03:05.534 --> 00:03:07.267
-Interesting.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.267 --> 00:03:08.734
Joe Rogan.
-Joe Rogan.

00:03:08.734 --> 00:03:11.534
[ Applause ]

00:03:11.534 --> 00:03:13.868
And, finally,
a man in the U.K. was arrested

00:03:13.868 --> 00:03:16.901
after he led police
on a 35-mile chase.

00:03:16.901 --> 00:03:18.067
And when they finally
pulled him over,

00:03:18.067 --> 00:03:20.501
he showed them a license
from Legoland.

00:03:20.501 --> 00:03:24.000
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.901
And he'd still be locked up
if he didn't have

00:03:25.901 --> 00:03:27.467
that "Monopoly"
"Get out of jail free" card.

00:03:27.467 --> 00:03:28.634
We have a great show.

